# Steel sections

A small library for the tutorial: a steel grade and four hot-rolled IPE
sections. Other documents import it with `texl.import` (lesson 8). Section
moduli W in mm³, masses in kg/m, heights h in mm.

<%
grade = {name: "S355", fy: 355},   # yield strength in N/mm²

IPE = {
    IPE240: {name: "IPE 240", h: 240, W: 324000, mass: 30.7},
    IPE270: {name: "IPE 270", h: 270, W: 429000, mass: 36.1},
    IPE300: {name: "IPE 300", h: 300, W: 557000, mass: 42.2},
    IPE330: {name: "IPE 330", h: 330, W: 713000, mass: 49.1}
}
%>
Grade <% grade.name %>: f<sub>y</sub> = <% grade.fy %> N/mm².
